             "copies/kx695yq4528#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Stamped, not written: five figures in a small serif type on the lower (upright) panel, with a faint point after the 3 and a short double rule to the right of the 4. Separators dropped, so 23.9.24. Nothing else in the crop."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
